# Walkthrough - Fixed Invalid Constant Value Error

I have fixed the "Invalid constant value" error in [app_theme.dart](file:///c:/projects/Antigravity/shmarthouse/shmarthouse_app/lib/core/theme/app_theme.dart). This error was caused by the use of `const` constructors for theme data that referenced dynamic values from `GoogleFonts`.

## Changes Made

### Theme Configuration
Modified [app_theme.dart](file:///c:/projects/Antigravity/shmarthouse/shmarthouse_app/lib/core/theme/app_theme.dart) to remove `const` from several theme components:

- **TextTheme**: Removed `const` because it uses [AppTextStyles](file:///c:/projects/Antigravity/shmarthouse/shmarthouse_app/lib/core/theme/app_text_styles.dart#7-58) (which uses `GoogleFonts` getters).
- **AppBarTheme**: Removed `const` because it uses `AppTextStyles.title`.
- **NavigationRailThemeData**: Removed `const` because it uses custom [TextStyle](file:///c:/projects/Antigravity/shmarthouse/shmarthouse_app/lib/core/theme/app_text_styles.dart#7-58) definitions which are not compile-time constants.

